; Moves one variable: `shadow_item_cull_mask` on the receiving side. The light reaches both panels,
; but only the upper panel's `light_mask` meets the shadow mask, so only it takes the bar's shadow.
; Every other shadow scene leaves both masks at 1, where every item receives, so a light that
; shadows an item its mask misses shows only here.

